{"gold_knowledge_id": "GK-H3-13-1", "gold_level": "candidate", "candidate_id": "H3-13", "snippet_id": "H3-13", "status": "confirmed_valid", "★ 计入有效 Gold": true, "knowledge_kind": "normative_rule_candidate", "rule_eligibility": "eligible", "strength": "SHOULD", "polarity": "unavailable", "target_route": "rule_channel", "extract_completeness": "unavailable", "evidence_span": "371-374", "source_sha256": "fe1f91d6874c826dd447a5caddcb9952a90ba1dd32ac822b872713134cb14d94", "source_document": "rfc4776.txt", "protocol": "DHCPv4", "evidence_text_sha256": "8c6a3014e425336e47e43cb4a3080f8858fd640b01184b22e1f41873890fffb4", "★ 适用的结构化字段": {"规范义务主体": {"value": "They（第371行先行词 Component values，即 civic address 分量值；书写者为生成该选项的 DHCP 实体）", "source": "C 判定语义等价，取 A 表述", "c_explicit": true, "needs_second_review": false}, "规范义务动作": {"value": "action=write、object=component values", "source": "C 仲裁明确指定", "c_explicit": true, "needs_second_review": false}, "规范义务对象": {"value": "object=component values", "source": "C 仲裁明确指定", "c_explicit": true, "needs_second_review": false}}, "★ 仲裁备注": [{"规范义务动作": "C 仲裁明确指定"}, {"规范义务对象": "C 仲裁明确指定"}], "★ 原始 A/B 标注": {"A 目标知识": "yes", "B 目标知识": "yes", "A 知识类型": "normative_rule_candidate", "B 知识类型": "protocol_syntax", "A 规则资格": "eligible", "B 规则资格": "ineligible", "A 强度": "SHOULD", "B 强度": "SHOULD", "A 完整性": "partial", "B 完整性": "cross_sentence_missing", "A 路由": "rule_channel", "B 路由": "structured_channel"}, "★ 仲裁记录": {"最终状态": "confirmed_valid", "仲裁人员/日期": "C / 2026-11-17"}, "★ 关键待裁裁定": {"最终状态": "arbitrated", "裁定结论": "yes", "证据与理由": "第371-372行「They SHOULD be written in mixed case, following the customary spelling.」为大写 SHOULD，强度本身无争议。判定：属规范建议而非协议语法——ABNF 不规定大小写、接收方须接受任意大小写，该句约束的是内容生成时的书写方式，不构成解析规则；故 knowledge_kind=normative_rule_candidate、rule_eligibility=eligible、route=rule_channel（采纳 A，否决 B 的 protocol_syntax）。但候选声称 MUST / encoded 实际对应第371行另一句「Component values MUST be encoded as UTF-8」，与 mixed case 句不是同一命题，故抽取完整性=partial（不是 A 的理由、也不是 B 的 cross_sentence_missing——两句均在同一跨度 371-374 内）。", "仲裁人员/日期": "C / 2026-11-17"}, "★ 版本": "v3 候选（★ 未冻结，★ 待第三方复核后审批）", "★ 基于版本 SHA256": "f4bfbdb5da1746416321ff2f20bcbf070330fa606f79c0715fccd8545fec6044", "★ 基于版本": "H3_Gold冻结基线.jsonl（v1）", "★ 与 v2 的关系": "★ v3 用同一套修正后的解析规则从 v1 重算；★ 可与 v2 逐项比对", "★ polarity 说明": "★ 候选最终状态表未提供极性列；★ 逐字段差异表也无该字段的独立裁定行；★ 按要求标记 unavailable，★ 不做自动推断", "★ extract_completeness 仲裁原文": "判 partial：候选声称 MUST / UTF-8 指向第371行另一句，与本句 SHOULD mixed case 不是同一命题；两句均在同一跨度内，故不是 cross_sentence_missing。", "★ extract_completeness 依据": "★ 未明确指定 ⇒ unavailable"}
