{"gold_knowledge_id": "GK-H3-19-1", "gold_level": "candidate", "candidate_id": "H3-19", "snippet_id": "H3-19", "status": "confirmed_valid", "★ 计入有效 Gold": true, "knowledge_kind": "normative_rule_candidate", "rule_eligibility": "eligible", "strength": "MAY", "polarity": "unavailable", "target_route": "rule_channel", "extract_completeness": "unavailable", "evidence_span": "137-140", "source_sha256": "26de2629fd165340696247278eeb95c4b49de7fccfa4d7cc39f89c116a7dac1a", "source_document": "rfc8910.txt", "protocol": "DHCPv4", "evidence_text_sha256": "7a8cd0fea35001263252b7b7e67164c6f98e488226edcde0eb7d4d2f205a8072", "★ 适用的结构化字段": {"规范义务主体": {"value": "DHCP servers", "source": "C 判定语义等价，取 A 表述", "c_explicit": true, "needs_second_review": false}, "规范义务对象": {"value": "object=the Captive Portal option", "source": "C 仲裁明确指定", "c_explicit": true, "needs_second_review": false}, "条件": {"value": "条件为空（该状语不是触发条件）", "source": "C 仲裁明确指定（判 X）", "c_explicit": true, "needs_second_review": false}}, "★ 仲裁备注": [{"规范义务对象": "C 仲裁明确指定"}, {"条件": "C 仲裁明确指定（判 X）"}], "★ 原始 A/B 标注": {"A 目标知识": "yes", "B 目标知识": "yes", "A 知识类型": "normative_rule_candidate", "B 知识类型": "normative_rule_candidate", "A 规则资格": "eligible", "B 规则资格": "eligible", "A 强度": "MAY", "B 强度": "MAY", "A 完整性": "full", "B 完整性": "partial", "A 路由": "rule_channel", "B 路由": "rule_channel"}, "★ 仲裁记录": {"最终状态": "confirmed_valid", "仲裁人员/日期": "C / 2026-11-17"}, "★ 关键待裁裁定": {"最终状态": "arbitrated", "裁定结论": "no", "证据与理由": "第139-140行「DHCP servers MAY send the Captive Portal option without any explicit request.」判定：「without any explicit request」限定的是「允许发送的范围」（可未经请求即发送），不是触发条件，不应单列为 condition（采纳 A 的条件判空）。但候选把该状语并入了 object（object=the Captive Portal option without any explicit request），object 不纯，故抽取完整性=partial（结论采纳 B，理由不同：不是条件缺失，而是 object 混入状语）。Gold 记 object=the Captive Portal option，状语转为备注。", "仲裁人员/日期": "C / 2026-11-17"}, "★ 版本": "v3 候选（★ 未冻结，★ 待第三方复核后审批）", "★ 基于版本 SHA256": "f4bfbdb5da1746416321ff2f20bcbf070330fa606f79c0715fccd8545fec6044", "★ 基于版本": "H3_Gold冻结基线.jsonl（v1）", "★ 与 v2 的关系": "★ v3 用同一套修正后的解析规则从 v1 重算；★ 可与 v2 逐项比对", "★ polarity 说明": "★ 候选最终状态表未提供极性列；★ 逐字段差异表也无该字段的独立裁定行；★ 按要求标记 unavailable，★ 不做自动推断", "★ extract_completeness 仲裁原文": "判 partial（object 混入状语），采纳 B。", "★ extract_completeness 依据": "★ 未明确指定 ⇒ unavailable"}
