{"gold_knowledge_id": "GK-H3-05-2", "gold_level": "supplementary", "atomic_unit_id": "AU-01", "candidate_id": "H3-05", "snippet_id": "H3-05", "status": "confirmed_valid", "★ 计入有效 Gold": true, "knowledge_kind": "normative_rule_candidate", "rule_eligibility": "eligible", "strength": "MUST", "polarity": "positive", "target_route": "rule_channel", "proposition": "Multiple instances of this option may be present and MUST be concatenated in accordance with RFC 3396 [4].", "evidence_span": "214-215", "source_document": "rfc3925.txt", "source_sha256": "bae9d07c4553f636f2fdf3e95a6f136581079a2e3112aab65bd04e7da389d77d", "★ 适用的结构化字段": {}, "★ 裁定理由": "第214-215行「MUST be concatenated in accordance with RFC 3396 [4]」为独立 MUST 义务；A、B 均登记且字符串一致；候选 H3-05 只覆盖第216-217行 SHOULD 句，未覆盖本句。", "★ 仲裁记录": {"最终处置": "accepted", "仲裁人员/日期": "C/ 2026-11-17"}, "★ 原始标注": [{"审核者": "A", "候选 ID": "H3-05", "补充序号": 1, "补充命题原文": "Multiple instances of this option may be present and MUST be concatenated in accordance with RFC 3396 [4].", "强度": "MUST", "极性": "positive", "归并到单元": "AU-01"}, {"审核者": "B", "候选 ID": "H3-05", "补充序号": 1, "补充命题原文": "Multiple instances of this option may be present and MUST be concatenated in accordance with RFC 3396 [4].", "强度": "MUST", "极性": "positive", "归并到单元": "AU-01"}], "★ 版本": "v3 候选（★ 未冻结，★ 待第三方复核后审批）", "★ 基于版本 SHA256": "f4bfbdb5da1746416321ff2f20bcbf070330fa606f79c0715fccd8545fec6044", "★ 基于版本": "H3_Gold冻结基线.jsonl（v1）", "★ 与 v2 的关系": "★ v3 用同一套修正后的解析规则从 v1 重算；★ 可与 v2 逐项比对", "extract_completeness": "not_applicable", "★ extract_completeness 依据": "★ 补充知识级无抽取完整性概念"}
